 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-1000) 'An RFD number has four decimal digits.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-1000) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:02Z (RFD66606-1000) 'The first digit names the organization. This repository uses digit 1. The
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:03Z (RFD66606-1000) 'fabric manuals use digit 2. V-Sekai-fire's private manuals use digit 3
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:04Z (RFD66606-1000) '(operator, 2026-10-12). `fire/manuals` reserves digit 4 and has no RFD.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:05Z (RFD66606-1000) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:06Z (RFD66606-1000) 'The last three digits are the serial number. A new RFD takes the next unused
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:07Z (RFD66606-1000) 'serial under its own organization digit. A writer no longer checks another
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:08Z (RFD66606-1000) 'repository, because another organization cannot reach this digit.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

