 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:12Z (RFD66606-1000) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:13Z (RFD66606-1000) 'Three decimal digits give 1000 serials for each organization. This repository
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:14Z (RFD66606-1000) 'uses 131 of them.
 # tags: rfd:details
