 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:30Z (RFD66606-1000) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:31Z (RFD66606-1000) 'The category arc is not decoration. Without it, a manual site and anything else
 # tags: rfd:details
