 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:45Z (RFD66606-1000) '`fire/manuals` names a decision by its date rather than by a serial, so
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:46Z (RFD66606-1000) 'digit 4 is reserved and holds nothing. Digit 3 allocates 3NNN serials, and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:47Z (RFD66606-1000) 'its register stays with the private manuals that allocate from it. A reserved
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:48Z (RFD66606-1000) 'digit costs one line here. An unreserved one costs what the collision above
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:49Z (RFD66606-1000) 'cost, which was 113 numbers meaning two documents at once.
