 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:08Z (RFD66606-1000) 'above it, and the repetition is worth its cost. The mapping from a document
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1000  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:02:09Z (RFD66606-1000) 'number to its arc is the identity, so a reader who can read one can read the
 # tags: rfd:details
